3958373,"x":0.10675381844479531,"w":0.16775598526000979,"text":"chatting and laughing."},{"text":"(1","w":0.01960784316062926,"y":0.2485465118944814,"h":0.013081394961037107,"x":0.076252723103781228},{"x":0.1067538109460769,"h":0.01162790636734401,"text":"He had only run three miles when he fell over and","y":0.25000000045004889,"w":0.37037036895751951},{"h":0.012842418152922641,"text":"hurt his foot.","y":0.26247413961196919,"x":0.10659566953873796,"w":0.096176853179931646},{"y":0.28184845928488389,"text":"When Ray's leg was better, he asked Lisa on a date.","w":0.38562091827392581,"h":0.013322231870805279,"x":0.10675381583580386},{"h":0.011712622979995535,"text":"But he couldn't stand because he had hurt his ankle.","x":0.10675381553060148,"w":0.38779956817626954,"y":0.29933388834321129},{"text":"Lisa was watching the race when Ray fell over.","y":0.31681931760278903,"x":0.10675382089027721,"w":0.3442265701293945,"h":0.014576030512038707},{"y":0.33284883717926128,"x":0.10893246034892201,"h":0.011627907161410933,"text":"Six months later they got married","w":0.2483660125732422},{"h":0.011739248042301198,"y":0.36627906987834347,"text":"2 * Complete the sentences with the correct form of","x":0.05228758599822509,"w":0.43137252807617193},{"w":0.17211328506469725,"h":0.010407993338884203,"x":0.076252727810788554,"y":0.38218151548722823,"text":"the verbs in brackets."},{"w":0.39215686798095695,"text":"The official fired the gun and the race began (begin).","y":0.39966694436029293,"x":0.10239650664132985,"h":0.011670264673669828},{"x":0.076252720108271749,"text":"1 It was raining heavily when Ferguson","w":0.30065359115600587,"h":0.011656952539550347,"y":0.41423813481600991},{"x":0.10021787014826021,"w":0.13289759635925291,"h":0.010174418567717836,"y":0.42877906976773994,"text":"(crash) his Ferrari."},{"w":0.40305007934570314,"x":0.078431390428818665,"text":"2 When I reached the 10 km sign, the fastest runners","y":0.44171523701035809,"h":0.01332223187080539},{"x":0.20915033118614568,"y":0.4578488375140024,"w":0.2483660125732422,"h":0.011759821917988855,"text":"(already\/cross) the finishing line."},{"text":"3 The race began at 16:00 and the last cyclist","y":0.47238372116225824,"x":0.078431380631895919,"w":0.35076251983642576,"h":0.011796129037696668},{"x":0.21350762916116814,"y":0.48691860491952565,"text":"(finish) at exactly 17:08.","w":0.17647058486938474,"h":0.011832435760370963},{"y":0.5012489592110918,"w":0.41612197875976559,"h":0.011832435760370963,"text":"4 Diane was already at the gym when she realised she","x":0.076252741311838179},{"h":0.013081394961037107,"y":0.514534883696807,"w":0.13725489616394046,"text":"(forget) her towel.","x":0.21132897693618527},{"text":"5 Fyfe and Scott","w":0.1350762462615967,"y":0.53039134036477376,"h":0.011759822315022372,"x":0.078431374908417381},{"w":0.16628952026367183,"x":0.31107472741676562,"text":"_ (climb) Everest when","y":0.52766043045093713,"h":0.014610107891962598},{"text":"the accident happened.","x":0.10239651543347947,"w":0.18082788467407226,"y":0.54360465113866741,"h":0.013081394961037107},{"x":0.052287585739122379,"h":0.010407993338884314,"text":"3 * * Choose the correct verb forms.","y":0.56536219812232447,"w":0.31154684066772459},{"h":0.010175628725634711,"w":0.045751633644104006,"x":0.078431373482958866,"text":"1 R:","y":0.58284762704562731},{"y":0.58284762682402724,"h":0.013082605515987389,"w":0.28758169174194337,"text":"Right, Jones! It's a yellow card for you.","x":0.1481481567434072},{"h":0.0087209299740247381,"text":"J:","x":0.10239651448012733,"w":0.023965141773223883,"y":0.59883720933469309},{"y":0.5973837210213736,"x":0.12636165220139908,"w":0.3028322410583496,"h":0.010174418567717836,"text":"Oh Ref! What adid I do \/ had I done\/"},{"h":0.012052122301900448,"y":0.61315998555961693,"text":"was I doing?","w":0.095974855422973626,"x":0.15026965405852757},{"y":0.62790697677655349,"x":0.10457516371760012,"h":0.0087209299740247381,"w":0.023965141773223869,"text":"R:"},